// Task - P_SL3_NT_Yin_R_Task4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - InfoClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2203608749" "A Flood of Information"
// DetailString :
"P1400848231" "There is so much information dumped into your mind right now, you don't even know where to start in order to sift through it all. Needless to say, what bits you can focus on spell out a smorgasbord of vital information taken from the Asylum and the minds of its inhabitants; including both Malaise and Mother Mayhem.<br><br>If you get caught with this information in your mind, you are guaranteed a one way ticket to Lobotomy-ville, Population: drool."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - MemoryTransferClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2376356584" "Memory Transfer"
// DetailString :
"P3714215274" "Within the blink of an eye you felt the flood of information churning in your mind suddenly organize, and then rush out.<br><br>Vanessa took a moment to regain her composure, and then she gave you a smile and darted into another section of the tunnels where the Resistance waited for her.<br><br>Now it was up to you to find your own way out and draw away the pursuers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3768698299" "Penelope sings to you, but the song carries dark overtones.<br><br>Remove your mask<br>but be prepared<br>Mother's daughters drawing near.<br>Take my thoughts<br>into your own<br>for they have need of chaperone.<br>Bear them safely<br>bear them swift<br>to the mistress as a gift.<br>Keep on moving toward the light<br>with sacrifice we may do right."
// AcceptString :
"P3382826530" "Remove your carnival mask."
// SendOffString :
"P3690690715" "Your mind is suddenly flooded with information, more than you can process at one time.<br><br>You feel a seer begin to scan your mind, and only the reactivation of your carnival mask erases the sensation.<br><br>Looking down at the mask you realize who the mistress is that you need to visit; Vanessa DeVore, and you need to get to her fast, the seers are coming!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3237922585" "Deliver Information to Vanessa DeVore"

